@*  IMG-004 Fabric Input (signature) user manual. *@

<div class="help-doc">
    <div>
        <div class="help-h1">IMG-004 · FABRIC INPUT</div>
        <div class="help-sub">원단 장착 — 롤 스캔 → 색상 매칭 → 장착 (서명 화면)</div>

        <svg class="help-svg" viewBox="0 0 720 480" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect x="6" y="6" width="708" height="468" rx="10" fill="#000" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.18)" stroke-width="1.5" />
            <rect class="hs-region tbar" x="14" y="14" width="692" height="42" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="34" y="40">IMG-004 · STATION · LINE</text>

            <rect class="hs-region" x="14" y="68" width="340" height="120" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="88">▼ EXPECTED (from WO)</text>
            <text class="hs-label" x="28" y="118" style="font-size:16px;">FABRIC: BLK-VINYL-08</text>
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="142">Color: BLACK · Recipe: REC-01</text>
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="166">Roll needed: ≥ 200 m</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="78" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="78">1</text>

            <rect class="hs-region warn" x="368" y="68" width="338" height="120" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="382" y="88">▼ SCANNED ROLL</text>
            <text class="hs-label" x="382" y="118" style="font-size:16px;">LOT-RL-2026-0418</text>
            <text class="hs-sub" x="382" y="142">Color: BLACK · 340 m remain</text>
            <text class="hs-sub" x="382" y="166" fill="#86efac">✓ MATCH</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="378" cy="78" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="378" y="78">2</text>

            <rect class="hs-region" x="14" y="200" width="692" height="160" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="220">▼ AVAILABLE ROLLS · 30 most recent</text>
            @for (var i = 0; i < 4; i++)
            {
                var y = 232 + i * 30;
                var sel = i == 0;
                <g>
                    <rect x="28" y="@y" width="664" height="24" rx="4" fill="@(sel ? "rgba(124,58,237,.18)" : "rgba(0,0,0,.3)")" stroke="@(sel ? "rgba(196,181,253,.5)" : "rgba(124,58,237,.18)")" />
                    <text class="hs-sub" x="42" y="@(y+16)">LOT-RL-2026-04@(18-i) · BLACK · @(340-i*40) m</text>
                </g>
            }
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="210" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="210">3</text>

            <rect class="hs-region ok" x="40" y="376" width="640" height="50" />
            <text class="hs-label" x="360" y="408" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:20px;">✓ MOUNT ROLL</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="50" cy="386" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="50" y="386">4</text>

            <rect class="hs-region nav" x="14" y="432" width="692" height="32" />
        </svg>
    </div>

    <div>
        <div class="help-section-h">▶ <span class="h-sec-en">READ THE SCREEN</span><span class="h-sec-ko">화면 읽기</span></div>
        <div class="help-steps">
            <div class="help-step"><div class="help-step-num">1</div><div class="help-step-body"><div class="help-step-en">Expected fabric — pulled from the active WO recipe.</div><div class="help-step-ko">예상 원단 — 활성 WO 레시피에서.</div></div></div>
            <div class="help-step warn"><div class="help-step-num">2</div><div class="help-step-body"><div class="help-step-en">Scanned roll. ✓ MATCH = colour OK. ✗ MISMATCH = mounting is blocked.</div><div class="help-step-ko">스캔된 롤. ✓ 매칭 = 컬러 일치. ✗ 불일치 = 장착 차단.</div></div></div>
            <div class="help-step"><div class="help-step-num">3</div><div class="help-step-body"><div class="help-step-en">Available roll list (tap to use as a fallback if no scanner).</div><div class="help-step-ko">사용 가능 롤 목록 (스캐너 없을 때 수동 선택).</div></div></div>
            <div class="help-step ok"><div class="help-step-num">4</div><div class="help-step-body"><div class="help-step-en">MOUNT writes PR_FabricIssue and updates the dashboard's FABRIC tile.</div><div class="help-step-ko">장착 시 PR_FabricIssue 기록 + 대시보드 갱신.</div></div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="help-callout warn">
            <div class="help-callout-i">⚠</div>
            <div class="help-callout-tx">
                <span class="h-call-en"><strong>BR-IMG-002:</strong> Every scan (even mismatches) is logged to PR_FabricIssueAttempt for traceability.</span><span class="h-call-ko">스캔 시도는 일치 여부와 무관하게 추적성을 위해 모두 기록됩니다.</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
